{"a1":[{"k":"title","cap":"Longest Stretch Without Repeats","say":"Let's solve Longest Stretch Without Repeats, using the Sliding Window approach.","card":{"title":"Longest Stretch Without Repeats","sub":"Sliding Window · Medium","pattern":"sliding-window"}},{"k":"problem","cap":"Given a string s, return the length of the longest contiguous piece of s in which no character appears twice.","card":{"lines":["Given a string s, return the length of the longest contiguous piece of s in which no character appears twice."]}},{"k":"example","cap":"For example, with s = \"abcabcbb\", the answer is 3. \"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works.","say":"For example, with s equals \"abcabcbb\", the answer is 3. \"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works.","card":{"lines":["Input: s = \"abcabcbb\"","Output: 3","\"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works."]}},{"k":"idea","cap":"Keep a window from L to R that never contains a repeat, and remember the last index where each character was seen.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"idea","cap":"When the new character at R was already seen inside the window, jump L just past that earlier copy. The window is valid again, so we update the best length.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"trace","cap":"Let's walk through it with s = \"abcabcbb\".","say":"Let's walk through it with s equals \"abcabcbb\".","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"0"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 0, the letter 'a'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"0"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'a', length 1. Best so far: 1.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"1"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 1, the letter 'b'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":1}],"w":[0,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"1"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'ab', length 2. Best so far: 2.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":1}],"w":[0,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"2"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 2, the letter 'c'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":2}],"w":[0,2]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"2"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'abc', length 3. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":2}],"w":[0,2]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 3, the letter 'a'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":0},{"l":"R","i":3}],"w":[0,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"'a' is already in the window, so L jumps to index 1.","ln":{"python":5,"java":7},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":1},{"l":"R","i":3}],"w":[1,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'bca', length 3. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":1},{"l":"R","i":3}],"w":[1,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 4, the letter 'b'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":1},{"l":"R","i":4}],"w":[1,4]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"'b' is already in the window, so L jumps to index 2.","ln":{"python":5,"java":7},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":2},{"l":"R","i":4}],"w":[2,4]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'cab', length 3. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":2},{"l":"R","i":4}],"w":[2,4]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 5, the letter 'c'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":2},{"l":"R","i":5}],"w":[2,5]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"'c' is already in the window, so L jumps to index 3.","ln":{"python":5,"java":7},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":3},{"l":"R","i":5}],"w":[3,5]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'abc', length 3. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":3},{"l":"R","i":5}],"w":[3,5]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 6, the letter 'b'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":3},{"l":"R","i":6}],"w":[3,6]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"'b' is already in the window, so L jumps to index 5.","ln":{"python":5,"java":7},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":5},{"l":"R","i":6}],"w":[5,6]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"4"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'cb', length 2. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":5},{"l":"R","i":6}],"w":[5,6]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"6"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"R moves to index 7, the letter 'b'.","ln":{"python":3,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":5},{"l":"R","i":7}],"w":[5,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"6"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"'b' is already in the window, so L jumps to index 7.","ln":{"python":5,"java":7},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":7},{"l":"R","i":7}],"w":[7,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"6"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window is 'b', length 1. Best so far: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":7},{"l":"R","i":7}],"w":[7,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"7"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"done","cap":"The answer is 3.","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"L","i":7},{"l":"R","i":7}],"w":[7,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"3"},{"k":"b","v":"7"},{"k":"c","v":"5"}]}]}},{"k":"complexity","cap":"Time complexity is O(n) and extra space is O(k). R visits every character once and L only moves forward, so the work is linear. The map holds at most one entry per distinct character, k.","say":"Time complexity is O of n and extra space is O of k. R visits every character once and L only moves forward, so the work is linear. The map holds at most one entry per distinct character, k.","card":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(k)"}},{"k":"outro","cap":"That's the Sliding Window approach. Now try writing it yourself, in Java or Python!"}]}